{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f53725b4-e0a4-52ab-85a9-c34d04ab5ca7", "source_ordinal": 2871, "reading_ordinal": 1182, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "一个坑", "published_at": "2022-03-26T23:27:48+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/4b28e394ad1911ecb9d152540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这一篇被知乎反复删除，原因不明。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我觉得这次认知战里面最大的一个智商筛选器，就是所谓的“普京冲动”、“普京被忽悠”、“普京误判”、“普京没想到”。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "首先，看清楚普京的履历——", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "KGB出身；", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "五常国家元首；", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "从国运最低点接位；", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "持续在位20余年；", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "在位期间发起并领导了至少五次对外军事行动，战绩全胜。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这都是没有任何美化、任何夸张的最朴素的事实。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "没人会说他肯定算无遗策。", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但是要说他会基于“肯定一帆风顺”、“西方肯定不会制裁得太厉害”、“欧洲肯定不吭声”、“内部肯定没人搞事”、“乌军肯定会投降”、“泽连斯基肯定会投降”、“北约肯定不会援助”、“俄军肯定不会有大损失”、“乌克兰翻浆期一定不发生”……等等等等现在无数人拿出来翻来覆去说他失算的预判组合来发动一场战争——这么说的人起码要有【相当的履历】才行。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 353}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "否则一群四十岁的某特定专业的专家（甚至二十几岁学生），基于自己不知当过几天国家领袖、领导过什么战争、不知道干过几天情报、不知道经历过几次战争迷雾、不知道做过几次大国外交……的“经验”，断言“普京肯定失算了”，未免有点太……disproportion。", "char_start": 354, "char_end": 479}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "太“比例失调”了。", "char_start": 480, "char_end": 489}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "类似逼得集团总裁发文“新入职员工谈论公司战略一律开除”的这种级别的disproportion。", "char_start": 490, "char_end": 537}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "如果你提出的是一种罕见的、极其曲折和隐蔽的，99.9%的常人都没想到的奇策，说普京没预料到，那也罢了。", "char_start": 538, "char_end": 589}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你一个二十几岁学生，引用另一群二十几岁学生/三四十岁“专家”/“媒体人”的兴奋和自信宣告，一起跟着断言普京失算，不觉得这是一个——就不说“荒谬”吧——缺乏有效性的行为吗？", "char_start": 590, "char_end": 675}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我倒不是说西方这些反制肯定无效，但是说截至目前西方所做的一切“反制”“超出了普京的想象”，这恐怕是一种过于强烈的自欺欺人。", "char_start": 676, "char_end": 737}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "连高中生都想得到的措施，可能超出普京的预期范围之外吗？", "char_start": 738, "char_end": 765}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "普京有可能假设西方不会采取任何一种可能的反制吗？", "char_start": 766, "char_end": 790}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这看上去是在说普京、在说乌克兰，但实际上根本不是，这说的是你。", "char_start": 791, "char_end": 822}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "一个人如果毫不怀疑的相信这一点，会让人对ta的判断力产生深刻怀疑——因为这理性残缺得丧失基本常识了。", "char_start": 823, "char_end": 873}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "俄乌冲突怎么落幕先放一旁——你的朋友、投资人和客户可能因此离开你。", "char_start": 874, "char_end": 907}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "副驾上的客人发现你分不清红绿灯，看不见绿化带，ta能不害怕吗？这跟坐醉驾的车有何本质区别？ta能不跳车吗？", "char_start": 908, "char_end": 961}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你是需要保持别人的信心来过日子的。", "char_start": 962, "char_end": 979}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "而1450只是复读脚本的僵尸账号，ta们是没有这问题的的。", "char_start": 980, "char_end": 1009}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "再说一遍，我无意反对你对俄乌局势的任何个人判断或者立场，我只是提醒你们，在这个过程中注意这些事对你自己的深刻影响。", "char_start": 1010, "char_end": 1067}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "它不但对你的立论力度没有帮助，还会严重的损害你自己的品牌价值。", "char_start": 1068, "char_end": 1099}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "其实你最后是不是预测对了结果，根本没那么重要——恕我直言，分析的首要目的并不是准确的预测结果，因为这是不可能的。", "char_start": 1100, "char_end": 1156}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "真正重要的是你是怎么探讨这些问题的，你在这过程中是怎么管理自己的情绪、管理自己可能的偏向性，怎么多维度的怀疑自己的推测。", "char_start": 1157, "char_end": 1217}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这才是参与这些事对你真正可能有益的做法。", "char_start": 1218, "char_end": 1238}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "望三思。", "char_start": 1239, "char_end": 1243}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 31}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0190"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：普京；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“一个坑”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这一篇被知乎反复删除，原因不明。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这一篇被知乎反复删除，原因不明。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a484752b-b139-5614-a16d-413289c73684", "source_ordinal": 2870, "reading_ordinal": 1183, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "乱", "published_at": "2022-03-27T02:42:10+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/519396694/answer/2409122255"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这会是一次很好的全民教育。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "迫使人自己对照将来的事实发展反思自己在迷雾中自我导航的得失成败。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "现在各人有各人笃定的观点，谁也无法说服你，这没什么。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但是最后结果出来了，如果与你所预料的不同，甚至截然相反，对你会是一个很好的现实启发。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "那时候你好回去检查自己是在哪里开始看错的，在哪些地方你本来可以察觉到不对，但是却被你放过去了。到底哪些人说的是真话，哪些人说的不是？", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "乱是避免不了的，人生常在迷雾摸索行进，这其实是一个恒久的常态。", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "学会摸索真相，是每个人的必修课，这一次的乱，对你是个很好的机会。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "好好把握吧。", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 255}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0190"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价 2022 年俄乌战争开始后中国互联网上的乱象？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“乱”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这会是一次很好的全民教育。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这会是一次很好的全民教育。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1af3d00d-2d7c-5355-9846-72e318421609", "source_ordinal": 2869, "reading_ordinal": 1184, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "诉诸权威", "published_at": "2022-03-27T13:24:20+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/64959012/answer/2409606638"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“诉诸权威”的指控经常被用来反对资历的意义，是年轻人最想用、最爱用、也最常用的“思想武器”之一。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但是这个武器是有使用须知的。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "之所以诉诸权威是错误的，是因为客观事实的有效性绝对的高于权威的断言。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在有相反的、双方共同认定的事实的前提下，认为权威与客观事实相悖的断言有高于客观事实的效力，这才叫做“诉诸权威的错误”。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 158}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "举个例子，一边是双方都认同的、与权威理论相抵触的实验数据的前提下，认为权威的理论更正确，这个叫做“诉诸权威的谬误”。", "char_start": 159, "char_end": 217}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但是，如果在你们的讨论中不存在“双方都认同的事实”呢？", "char_start": 218, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "现在的天平两端就不再是“事实vs权威”，而变成了“你（或你自己选择的权威）vs权威”。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 289}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "事实 vs 权威，权威输。", "char_start": 290, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你（或你选择的权威）vs 权威，资历较浅的权威只能被实践性的认为比较不可靠。", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "看清楚加粗部分——实践性的、比较不可靠。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这不意味着宣布“较小的权威的观点肯定是错的”——是对是错，因为没有事实这一终极权威的在场，根本没有答案。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 416}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "但是事情逼在你头上，你必须要对这事有一个确定的态度去往下做计划、做决策、开展行动，由不得你说“都有理、都对”这种片汤话，你将不得不在实践层面上下个赌注——比如你自己（或你喜欢的另一个医生）觉得自己是消化不良，而钟南山说你是胃癌——你将必须具体的决定自己是要去住院还是吃一包胃肠药。", "char_start": 417, "char_end": 557}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这时，你总要下一个赌注。", "char_start": 558, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "注意，没人反对你把赌注下在小权威那一方、你自己那一方，这是你不可剥夺的权利——人有一意孤行的自由。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 620}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但是，看清楚，", "char_start": 621, "char_end": 628}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如果对方处在与你同样的位置上选择了“下注到较大的/与你选择相反的权威那一边”，", "char_start": 629, "char_end": 668}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "那不叫“诉诸权威的谬误”。", "char_start": 669, "char_end": 682}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "同时，你一定要注意，“那个权威比你（或你选择的权威）有更多的经验和成就”，这本身是一个事实。", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 730}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你只是认定“我自己独立判断的权威”的有效性高于了“这个人经验比我多”这个事实而已。", "char_start": 731, "char_end": 772}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "至于这种认定本身算不算“诉诸（自身）权威”的错误，老实说，在形式逻辑上是毫无疑问算的。", "char_start": 773, "char_end": 816}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "只是，人类注定要犯下这种错误，因为人类没有“不用自己的意志来指导自己的判断”的功能。", "char_start": 817, "char_end": 859}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "“诉诸自己理性的权威”，是人类无法摆脱的、唯一的行为模式，指责它是“错的”，是没有意义的。", "char_start": 860, "char_end": 905}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0190"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：诉诸权威是逻辑谬误吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“诉诸权威”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““诉诸权威”的指控经常被用来反对资历的意义，是年轻人最想用、最爱用、也最常用的“思想武器”之一。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“诉诸权威”的指控经常被用来反对资历的意义，是年轻人最想用、最爱用、也最常用的“思想武器”之一。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 48, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "072af26f-5f98-56ed-9555-1f3d9913ef6a", "source_ordinal": 2868, "reading_ordinal": 1185, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "野兽", "published_at": "2022-03-28T02:32:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/524186632/answer/2410557436"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不是所有说人话的动物都是智慧生物；", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "也不是所有长得像人的动物都有人性。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "任何正义，只要它在任何意义上成其为一种正义，都不可能成为抛弃人性的合理理由。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不认同这一点的人，其人性已经丧失。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不要以为这种人只存在于乌军之中。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "ta很可能正在你身边给这些乌军点赞。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "在ta的心里，", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "只要伤害了ta的人都不是人。", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "信不信，ta已经快对你忍无可忍了。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "及时认出这些野兽，离ta们远点。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 191}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0190"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待乌克兰士兵嬉皮笑脸地给俄军阵亡士兵的母亲告知死讯，看到对方哭泣开怀大笑，称狗会吃掉遗体?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“野兽”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不是所有说人话的动物都是智慧生物；”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不是所有说人话的动物都是智慧生物；", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "dd48459c-0fa3-5be0-8752-054105ce60c3", "source_ordinal": 2867, "reading_ordinal": 1186, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "话事人", "published_at": "2022-03-28T15:37:46+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/307458890/answer/2411419790"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "回答这个问题的人，需要首先注意中国的处理这类问题的基本逻辑——这不会是一个会交给“全民公决”或者“舆论公决”议题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "简单来说，这事不由你说了算。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "它是由一群经过非常复杂而漫长的过程自然筛选出来的人去做决定。这些人当然也不是上帝，不可能不犯错误，但是等你长大了，知道是非好歹了，你大概总会庆幸——“幸亏当初不是我说了算。”这甚至可以算是你真正懂事的一个标志。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你也不要听那些选票主义者、公投主义者们扯淡。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 201}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一方面，ta们自己的治理成绩稀烂，专长于崽卖爷田、爷卖崽田制造盈利幻觉，根本没什么可参考的。", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "另一方面，你绝非如ta们所说的那样，“没有任何途径去影响这个体系的决策结果”。最典型的——它在科技方面，极大的受到钱学森们的影响；农业方面，高度尊重袁隆平们；防疫方面，深刻倚靠钟南山们。", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你只是先要成为钱学森、袁隆平、钟南山。是这些人在决定到时候能不能帮、怎么帮、帮到哪一步——而不是“知乎众之总和”。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而你在知乎不断的表达你想怎么样、你不想怎么样，会极大的耽误你成为钱学森、袁隆平、钟南山。这在本质上、实践上，不但不是在争取和行使你的权利，而且是在虚掷和放弃你的权利。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 484}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不管你喜不喜欢这个现实，这就是现在的实际游戏规则，不遵守这个规则，只会提前被罚出局。", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 527}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果以“实现影响力”为诉求，那么，你在知乎看东西，应该以寻求别的东西来帮助你成为钱、袁、钟为专注方向；你在知乎写东西，应该以引出能帮你成为钱、袁、钟的人与言为专注方向。", "char_start": 528, "char_end": 612}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "凡读凡写，只字勿忘。", "char_start": 613, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "念念不忘，兹有回响。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 634}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0190"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果俄罗斯和美国发生战争，中国应不应该帮忙？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“话事人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“回答这个问题的人，需要首先注意中国的处理这类问题的基本逻辑——这不会是一个会交给“全民公决”或者“舆论公决”议题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "回答这个问题的人，需要首先注意中国的处理这类问题的基本逻辑——这不会是一个会交给“全民公决”或者“舆论公决”议题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 57, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8aee5c23-2248-5655-b543-529ba961f3a2", "source_ordinal": 2866, "reading_ordinal": 1187, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "黑白冒犯", "published_at": "2022-03-29T00:38:57+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/524563289/answer/2412210158"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "冒犯有两种，一黑一白。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果对方宽容你这个冒犯，是勇气和器量的证明，那么其实就没有边界可言。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你越狠，对方如果能宽容，对对方的形象反而更加增色——这就属于白冒犯。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这实际上是一种类似“胸口碎大石”式的配合演出。一锤下去，石碑都碎两半，人人都要夸躺着的那位一声“好汉”。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果对方宽容的是他无权宽容的冒犯，那就不但不成其为勇气的证明，反而要成为一种懦弱。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你程度再轻，轻如一根鸿毛，也是罪无可恕。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 198}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这就是黑冒犯。", "char_start": 199, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你要是嘲弄的是威尔史密斯本人，多狠他都会扛，因为扛住对他自己是一种自信的证明。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 247}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你嘲弄的是他有责任守护的人，那么他根本没权利替那个被侵害的人原谅你。", "char_start": 248, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "只要那个被嘲弄的人没笑，他就有义务要善尽守护的责任，否则会构成重大失职。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 319}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不过这是不是要用当场打耳光来试试，这个是一个见仁见智的问题，也与这个主题无关了。", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这不是一个程度问题，这是一个性质问题。", "char_start": 362, "char_end": 381}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0190"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：威尔·史密斯因克里斯·洛克开妻子脱发的玩笑打了他，这类脱口秀表演的边界在哪儿？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“黑白冒犯”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“冒犯有两种，一黑一白。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "冒犯有两种，一黑一白。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2104f9c6-4204-5f61-ad39-f5b88c676617", "source_ordinal": 2865, "reading_ordinal": 1188, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "真的啊", "published_at": "2022-03-31T11:12:06+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/524313516/answer/2416156623"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "真的啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 4}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "看来大家对这个短答案意见很大，那么说一说。", "char_start": 5, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）因为短，就是开玩笑吗？“补强”到哪去了？", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "2）这个答案是如此的明显而直白，当事人自己就应该100%想到了。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但是当事人自己拒绝了往前迈出如此简单的一步。这实际上是通过拒绝迈出第一步，而避免面对第一步之后的问题。心里抱着一种“即使这样也可以”的侥幸，从而避免“如果这样不可以该怎么办”的自我追问。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这很明显是一个逻辑上不可操作的行为模式，已经到了“我一见到光就会死，我这种人适合晒太阳吗”的程度。结论当然是也只能是“真的”。你必须在“在求助之前自我寻求方案”的阶段直接越过逻辑显然而必然的步骤，否则你真正的问题是没打算为自己负责，视生活为儿戏。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 301}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这样的行为模式是怎么养成的？就是因为ta次次问这种“省力问”都有好心人给ta一个暖心长答案。这答案说了什么，其实ta根本没听到，也不在乎。ta只看到自己还是有人在乎的，哭一声还是有人理、有人哄的。ta在乎的是这样干还可以继续获得关爱，说明这个做法还没破产，爹妈、前男友说的“这样是不行的”显然是“吓人的”。", "char_start": 302, "char_end": 455}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "因为明明有人哄，不是吗？", "char_start": 456, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "其实这么省力的问题，是不该得到回答的，一个寂静无声的世界是对这种行为模式最好的挽救。多给三个字，其实已经超过了ta应得的。", "char_start": 470, "char_end": 531}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "再说一遍，", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "真的啊。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 543}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "heading", "index": 12, "text": "你不要做这种人啊！", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 554}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "另外，额外提醒一下。", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 566}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我喜欢怎样答，就怎样答。", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不喜欢，不要看。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 589}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "少废话。", "char_start": 590, "char_end": 594}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0190"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我原本很喜欢一个男生，可知道他也喜欢我的时候，我会开始远离他并且恶心，我这种人真的不应该谈恋爱吗?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“真的啊”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“真的啊。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "真的啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 4, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6faf3661-664b-56e9-ac89-86446d0d236d", "source_ordinal": 2864, "reading_ordinal": 1189, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "L4", "published_at": "2022-04-02T21:48:16+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/525589861/answer/2420508915"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "无人驾驶只有两个现实可行的方案。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一个是在一望无际的内蒙古草原或者撒哈拉大沙漠。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一个是配合自动换电技术，在智能公路上交由第三方接管成为无轨轨道交通。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "用人工智能替代司机没有可见的前途。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "理由主要有二：", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "1）认为“现实世界的多样性超不过人工智能算法的预料”，这其实是以人僭神，自信自己的智慧可以超越一切造物的可能，必遭惨败。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "2）认为“现实世界的多样性固然必然超过人工智能算法的预料，但其失败的代价微不足道，可以无视”，这是灭霸式的社会工程论，和“处死残疾人是提高人口素质的小小代价”没有本质的区别。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "BRT 和地铁相比有哪些优劣之处？\n我用 5G 网络可以干什么？", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "在第二篇里有一个自动驾驶的专章。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 299}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 251, "sample": "BRT 和地铁相比有哪些优劣之处？\n我用 5G 网络可以干什么？"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0190"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：潍柴动力董事长谭旭光称「无人驾驶就是忽悠，辅助驾驶是希望」背后有那些信息值得关注？你认可这个观点吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“L4”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“无人驾驶只有两个现实可行的方案。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "无人驾驶只有两个现实可行的方案。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
